  "description": "A free, MIT-licensed fluent configuration wrapper around OpenIddict for building OAuth2/OIDC token servers in ASP.NET Core — an alternative to Duende IdentityServer's revenue-based commercial license. AutoAuth does not implement any protocol or cryptographic logic itself; all token issuance, validation, and signing is delegated to OpenIddict (Apache 2.0).",
