  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1: Add missing package icon. 1.0.0: Initial release. Fluent AddAutoAuthServer/AddAutoAuthValidation configuration wrappers over OpenIddict, an idempotent client seeder (AutoAuthClientSeeder), and a ready-made client_credentials token endpoint (MapAutoAuthClientCredentialsEndpoint). Interactive flows (authorization_code with user login) require your own login/consent endpoint — see README.",
